# ── Plugin Configuration ────────────────────────────────────────
# User-level overrides for Fisher-managed plugins.
# Fisher-managed files (autopair.fish, abbr_tips.fish, etc.) must
# NOT be edited directly — they're overwritten on `fisher update`.
# Put customizations here instead.

# autopair.fish — default pairs are fine, no overrides needed.

# fish-abbreviation-tips — default behavior works well with 07-git-abbr.
# To silence tips for specific commands: set -U ABBR_TIPS_EXCLUDE "ll la"

# puffer-fish — default expansions:
#   .. → ../..     ... → ../../..     .... → ../../../..
#   !! → last command   !$ → last arg   !* → all args
